# E3d (D9, D10): raw vectors through the value API; zero copy for the 8 byte kinds (`same`), staging buffers for the narrow kinds
sub output
sub viOut
sub vfOut
sub vbOut
sub vhOut
sub vgOut
sub vwOut
sub vsOut
api
vec viIn i64 5 -2 3
vec vfIn f64 3 0.5 0.25
vec vwIn u64 3 18446744073709549568 -2048
vec vbIn u8 6 250 1
vec vhIn i16 3 -32768 32767
vec vgIn f32 3 0.1 1
